import ../../../ui/scene_instance_picking.dl
import ../../../ui/scene_surfaces.dl
import ../../../ui/scene_buffers.dl

to [expect scene anchor value] {a number:actual} [near] {a number:expected}:
    require condition ((the absolute value of (actual - expected)) < 0.00001) reporting "An anchored scene placement differs from its affine transform"

set root to an identity UI scene pose
set root's position to a UI scene vector from [1.0,2.0,3.0]
set child to an identity UI scene pose
set child's position to a UI scene vector from [0.0,1.0,0.0]
set mesh to a UI box mesh with 1 by 1 by 1 segments
set material to a UI scene material with color (UI ink 255 255 255) roughness 0.5 metalness 0.0
set model to a UI scene model from [
    a UI scene group named "root" under -1 at root,
    a UI scene mesh part named "shape" under 0 using mesh with material material at child,
    a UI scene group named "other root" under -1 at child
]
set item to a UI scene instance of model
set independent to a UI scene instance of model
set matrix to an identity graphics matrix
store (2.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number) into matrix at 0
store (0.5 as a 32 bit floating-point number) into matrix at 4
store (3.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number) into matrix at 5
store ((-4.0) as a 32 bit floating-point number) into matrix at 10
store (10.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number) into matrix at 12
store (20.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number) into matrix at 13
store (30.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number) into matrix at 14
set anchor to a UI scene transform from matrix
set UI scene anchor in item to anchor
set placed to the UI scene placement of part 1 in item
expect scene anchor value (the item at 12 in placed's transform's matrix) near 13.5
expect scene anchor value (the item at 13 in placed's transform's matrix) near 29.0
expect scene anchor value (the item at 14 in placed's transform's matrix) near 18.0
expect scene anchor value (placed's transform's handedness) near -1.0
expect scene anchor value (placed's bounds' minimum's x) near 12.25
expect scene anchor value (placed's bounds' maximum's x) near 14.75
expect scene anchor value (placed's bounds' minimum's y) near 27.5
expect scene anchor value (placed's bounds' maximum's z) near 20.0
set packed to a UI scene shader instance through (placed's transform) with material material casting shadow true receiving shadow true
expect scene anchor value (the item at 12 in packed's matrix) near 13.5
expect scene anchor value (the item at 13 in packed's matrix) near 29.0
expect scene anchor value (the item at 14 in packed's matrix) near 18.0
expect scene anchor value (the item at 0 in packed's normals) near 0.5
expect scene anchor value (the item at 1 in packed's normals) near (-1.0 / 12.0)
expect scene anchor value (the item at 5 in packed's normals) near (1.0 / 3.0)
expect scene anchor value (the item at 10 in packed's normals) near -0.25
set other to the UI scene placement of part 2 in item
expect scene anchor value (the item at 12 in other's transform's matrix) near 10.5
expect scene anchor value (the item at 13 in other's transform's matrix) near 23.0
set ray to @intrinsic("construct", UI scene ray, (a UI scene vector from [13.5,29.0,40.0]), (a UI scene vector from [0.0,0.0,-1.0]))
set selection to the UI scene selection from ray in item including backfaces false
require condition ((selection's part = 1) and (selection's hit's hit)) reporting "Picking did not use the attached instance's world transform"
expect scene anchor value (selection's hit's point's z) near 20.0
set revision to item's revision
set UI scene anchor in item to anchor
refresh UI scene instance item
require condition (item's revision = revision) reporting "An unchanged attachment invalidated the instance"
set pose to an identity UI scene pose
set pose's position to a UI scene vector from [1.0,0.0,0.0]
set UI scene root pose in item to pose
set placed to the UI scene placement of part 1 in item
expect scene anchor value (the item at 12 in placed's transform's matrix) near 15.5
expect scene anchor value (the item at 13 in placed's transform's matrix) near 29.0
set other to the UI scene placement of part 2 in item
expect scene anchor value (the item at 12 in other's transform's matrix) near 12.5
set placed to the UI scene placement of part 1 in independent
expect scene anchor value (the item at 12 in placed's transform's matrix) near 1.0
expect scene anchor value (the item at 13 in placed's transform's matrix) near 3.0
expect scene anchor value (the item at 14 in placed's transform's matrix) near 3.0
set UI scene anchor in item to (a UI scene transform from (an identity graphics matrix))
set placed to the UI scene placement of part 1 in item
expect scene anchor value (the item at 12 in placed's transform's matrix) near 2.0
expect scene anchor value (the item at 13 in placed's transform's matrix) near 3.0
close UI scene instance item
close UI scene instance independent
print line "Scene anchors preserve affine attachments, root articulation, bounds, picking and independent instances."
